{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8LoomCore8DatabaseC5closeyyF","modules":[{"name":"LoomCore"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"close"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"title":"close()","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/loomcore\/database\/close()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database\/close()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/DatabaseActor","kind":"attribute","text":"DatabaseActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:8LoomCore13DatabaseActorC"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"close"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this when deterministic resource release is required rather than relying on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deallocation timing — for example, before deleting the underlying database file","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or when running large numbers of short-lived connections in tests. Any subsequent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"operation on this database will throw.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Deliberately synchronous and exempt from transaction gating, so it can serve as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"escape hatch for a stuck transaction: closing the connection makes the transaction’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remaining statements — and any waiting operations — fail with ","type":"text"},{"code":".databaseClosed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Statements in flight when ","type":"text"},{"code":"close()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs keep working — an iteration in progress","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"continues to completion — and the connection is fully released once their handles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are destroyed. Only new operations throw.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let tempURL = URL(fileURLWithPath: \"\/tmp\/scratch.sqlite\")","let db = try await Database.open(url: tempURL)","defer { Task { @DatabaseActor in db.close() } }","try await db.exec(\"CREATE TABLE scratch (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY)\")"]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Closes the SQLite connection and finalizes every cached prepared statement."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore","doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database"]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://LoomCore/documentation/LoomCore/Database":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Database","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"SQLite database connection serialized through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/DatabaseActor","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Database","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Database","url":"\/documentation\/loomcore\/database","kind":"symbol"},"doc://LoomCore/documentation/LoomCore/DatabaseActor":{"url":"\/documentation\/loomcore\/databaseactor","role":"symbol","title":"DatabaseActor","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/DatabaseActor","abstract":[{"text":"Global actor that serializes all SQLite access in LoomCore.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DatabaseActor","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DatabaseActor","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://LoomCore/documentation/LoomCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore","abstract":[{"text":"A type-safe SQLite wrapper for Swift 6+ built on actor isolation.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"LoomCore","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/loomcore"},"doc://LoomCore/documentation/LoomCore/Database/close()":{"url":"\/documentation\/loomcore\/database\/close()","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/LoomCore\/documentation\/LoomCore\/Database\/close()","type":"topic","title":"close()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Closes the SQLite connection and finalizes every cached prepared statement."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"close","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}